<QuestionLayout
  title="Can Traverse run models on a GPU or the Apple Neural Engine?"
  description="v0.15.0 can opt in to a signed Core ML variant on Apple hosts; default stays wasm-cpu. Governed-path iPhone evidence (#1630) landed on main: BirdNET p95 141 ms per 3 s clip on one iPhone 14 Pro Max."
